            "title": "What’s the China strategy? - POLITICO",
            "snippets": [
              "# What’s the China strategy?\n**WHAT’S THE CHINA STRATEGY?** President Donald Trump is expected by Thursday to announce a plan to hit China with tariffs, investment restrictions and potentially other trade limits, but will these actions actually get Beijing to rein in an industrial policy that it only seemed to double down on when its legislature met this week?",
